<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian dlr steady, bonds firm post-data.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian dlr steady, bonds firm post-data.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian dollar held steady and bonds fell after the release of December quarter capital expenditure and final November quarter average weekly ordinary time earnings (AWOTE).</p>
<p>The dollar was US$0.7744/49 compared with US$0.0.7746/51 just before the data was released at 0030 GMT (11.30 a.m.), while the March 10-year bond futures contract rose to 92.325 against a pre-data 92.295.</p>
</text>
